Сайн байна!
150
00:09:25.146 --> 00:09:26.866
<i>Una cosa es segura...</i>
151
00:09:27.691 --> 00:09:28.241
За!
152
00:09:28.441 --> 00:09:30.285
<i>Este chico lo tenía todo.</i>
153
00:09:30.485 --> 00:09:32.621
- ¡Sí!
- <i>Hora de sacar la basura.</i>
154
00:09:32.988 --> 00:09:33.664
<i>¡Sí!</i>
155
